font-variant-position:normal;'>Metals<\/span><\/span><\/p><\/td><td style='border:1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow:hidden; padding:5pt;'><p style='line-height:1.2; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt;'><span style='background-color:transparent; color:#000000; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:11pt;'><span style='font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal;'>15<\/span><\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr style='height:0pt;'><td style='border:1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow:hidden; padding:5pt;'><p style='line-height:1.2; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt;'><span style='background-color:transparent; color:#000000; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:11pt;'><span style='font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal;'>Machinery &amp; Electrical Equipment<\/span><\/span><\/p><\/td><td style='border:1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow:hidden; padding:5pt;'><p style='line-height:1.2; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt;'><span style='background-color:transparent; color:#000000; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:11pt;'><span style='font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal;'>16+18<\/span><\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr style='height:0pt;'><td style='border:1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow:hidden; padding:5pt;'><p style='line-height:1.2; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt;'><span style='background-color:transparent; color:#000000; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:11pt;'><span style='font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal;'>Vehicles &amp; Equipment<\/span><\/span><\/p><\/td><td style='border:1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow:hidden; padding:5pt;'><p style='line-height:1.2; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt;'><span style='background-color:transparent; color:#000000; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:11pt;'><span style='font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal;'>17<\/span><\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr style='height:0pt;'><td style='border:1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow:hidden; padding:5pt;'><p style='line-height:1.2; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt;'><span style='background-color:transparent; color:#000000; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:11pt;'><span style='font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal;'>Miscellaneous<\/span><\/span><\/p><\/td><td style='border:1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow:hidden; padding:5pt;'><p style='line-height:1.2; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt;'><span style='background-color:transparent; color:#000000; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:11pt;'><span style='font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal;'>19+20+21<\/span><\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><\/figure><\/figure><\/figure><\/figure><\/div><\/div><div style='text-align:center;'>&nbsp;<\/div><\/li><li><strong>Port's Share of Economy's Maritime Trade: <\/strong>based on AIS-derived imports and exports at the port-level with respect to country totals during 2019-25.<\/li><\/ul><\/div><div><strong>Variables:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/div><div><ul><li><strong>portid:<\/strong>&nbsp;port unique id.&nbsp;<\/li><li><strong>portname:<\/strong>&nbsp;port name.&nbsp;<\/li><li><strong>lat:&nbsp;<\/strong>latitude of the port location.<\/li><li><strong>lon:&nbsp;<\/strong>longitude of the port location.<\/li><li><strong>vessel_count_total:<\/strong>&nbsp;yearly average number of all ships calling at the port. Estimated using AIS-derived portcalls data between 2019-2025. The total is calculated over the sum of&nbsp;<span style='font-family:Avenir Next W01, Avenir Next W00, Avenir Next, Avenir, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><strong>vessel_count_container<\/strong>,&nbsp;<\/span><strong>vessel_count_dry_bulk<\/strong>,&nbsp;<strong>vessel_count_general_cargo<\/strong>,&nbsp;<strong>vessel_count_roro<\/strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>vessel_count_tanker.<\/strong><br />&nbsp;<\/li><li><strong>vessel_count_container:<\/strong>&nbsp;yearly average number of containers calling at the port. Estimated using AIS-derived portcalls data between 2019-2025.<\/li><li><strong>vessel_count_dry_bulk:<\/strong>&nbsp;yearly average number of dry bulk carriers calling at the port. Estimated using AIS-derived portcalls data between 2019-2025.<\/li><li><strong>vessel_count_general_cargo:<\/strong>&nbsp;yearly average number of general cargo ships calling at the port. Estimated using AIS-derived portcalls data between 2019-2025.<\/li><li><strong>vessel_count_roro:<\/strong>&nbsp;yearly average number of Ro-Ro ships calling at the port. Estimated using AIS-derived portcalls data between 2019-2025.<\/li><li><strong>vessel_count_tanker:<\/strong>&nbsp;yearly average number of tankers calling at the port. Estimated using AIS-derived portcalls data between 2019-2025.<\/li><li><strong>industry_top1:<\/strong>&nbsp;first dominant traded industries based on the volume of goods estimated to flow through the port.<\/li><li><strong>industry_top2:&nbsp;<\/strong>second&nbsp;dominant traded industries based on the volume of goods estimated to flow through the port.<\/li><li><strong>industry_top3:&nbsp;<\/strong>third&nbsp;dominant traded industries based on the volume of goods estimated to flow through the port.<\/li><li><strong>share_country_maritime_import: <\/strong>based on AIS-derived imports volume at the port-level with respect to country totals during 2019-25.<\/li><li><strong>share_country_maritime_export:&nbsp;<\/strong>based on AIS-derived exports volume at the port-level with respect to country totals during 2019-25.<br />&nbsp;<\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div><div><div><strong>How to Cite?<\/strong><\/div><div><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;; font-size:16px;'>These datasets are based on raw AIS data from the United National Global Platform and estimates by the PortWatch team based on the methodology described in the paper. The recommended citation is:&nbsp;<\/span><i>\u201cSources: UN Global Platform; IMF PortWatch (<\/i><a style='background-color:transparent; box-sizing:border-box;' target='_blank' href='https://portwatch.imf.org/' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><i>portwatch.imf.org<\/i><\/a><i>).\u201d<\/i><\/div><\/div><\/div>","tags":[],"snippet":"PortWatch ports database.","thumbnail":"thumbnail/ago_downloaded.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-175.1811730036234,-54.81096156499186],[179.36292998725855,71.26854296098527]],"categories":[],"spatialReference":"102100","accessInformation":null,"classification":null,"licenseInfo":"https://www.imf.org/external/terms.htm","culture":"en-us","properties":{"indexJobId":""},"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://services9.arcgis.com/weJ1QsnbMYJlCHdG/arcgis/rest/services/PortWatch_ports_database/FeatureServer","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":4726784,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"commentsEnabled":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":2001423,"scoreCompleteness":55,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792252800000}